1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,350
Your open trade is drawn on the chart, with its profit or loss on the label.

2
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:11,350
To close it from the chart, click the X on its label.

3
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:15,710
The Close Position window opens first, so nothing closes until you confirm.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:19,570
Close all of it, or just part by changing the amount.

5
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:26,000
Click Ok to close it.

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,850
The trade is closed and its line is gone.

7
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:33,350
If Quick Trade is on, the X closes straight away without asking.

